    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700740/extras/130c8cfda8a82e1085ad0051f12f9387.avif?t=1747858774\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRIDDLE</strong> is a single-player horror simulation game set in an old meatball shop inherited from your uncle, who mysteriously disappeared years ago. From the outside, everything seems ordinary\u2014but inside, traces of the past, abandoned belongings, and an unresolved story are waiting to be uncovered. As you fulfill orders, you slowly begin to realize that this job isn\u2019t just about cooking meatballs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700740/extras/51e708ed0a3f9eac19d159d613c885bb.avif?t=1747858774\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to manage the meatball shop by taking customer orders, preparing and cooking meatballs according to recipes, and maintaining the kitchen. Along the way, you\u2019ll explore the shop to find clues about its hidden past.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700740/extras/130c8cfda8a82e1085ad0051f12f9387.avif?t=1747858774\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRIDDLE</strong> is a single-player horror simulation game set in an old meatball shop inherited from your uncle, who mysteriously disappeared years ago. From the outside, everything seems ordinary\u2014but inside, traces of the past, abandoned belongings, and an unresolved story are waiting to be uncovered. As you fulfill orders, you slowly begin to realize that this job isn\u2019t just about cooking meatballs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700740/extras/51e708ed0a3f9eac19d159d613c885bb.avif?t=1747858774\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to manage the meatball shop by taking customer orders, preparing and cooking meatballs according to recipes, and maintaining the kitchen. Along the way, you\u2019ll explore the shop to find clues about its hidden past.</p>",
